The standalone HTTP callback broker, client observation flow and browser-editor
example adapt the external-product integration from OpenGrove PR #126:
https://github.com/open-grove/opengrove/pull/126
Original revision: c98e26f5b5e4c5268277bb02609381e7e45fec04

The Pi event projection in src/pi/events.ts is adapted from pi-durable v1.2.0:
https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/blob/v1.2.0/packages/durable/src/harness/events.ts

